{
  "comment": "Scenes of the screenshot stand (plan step 0.3): tools/shots.ps1 runs the built client once per scene. tile = [X, Y] in world tiles (omit or null = spawn point), width = view width in tiles (40..96). args = extra client keys (E1-4: --paint-demo repaints the floors near the spawn into a test pattern: a lake with a sand shore, patches of every ground kind, a junction of all kinds 70 tiles to the east, torches along the path and a campfire on the east shore; E1-8: --day-tick N sets the world tick of the offline shot 0..35999: day 10800, dusk 22500, night 28800, dawn 35100; E2-1: --demo-piles puts ground item piles of every icon around the scene point; E2-2 / E2-4: --ui-demo bag|hotbar|craft|craft+bag|craft-hint shows the UI without a server, the craft scenes put a workbench, a campfire and a torch near the character; E2-5: --ui-demo build|chest|house — build mode (E2-11: a stone wall item in hand, no ribbon; a row of placed stone walls), grid and green/red ghosts, an open chest next to the bag, a house of stone walls with a door, a wooden floor, a workbench, a chest and a bed; E2-9: --ui-demo inv|inv-weapons|inv-buildings — one window bag + crafting with sections and subsections: Tools/Picks with a queue and a recipe tooltip, Weapons/Swords with the only-available filter, Buildings/Wood (E2-11: building recipes, wooden wall selected); E2-10: --ui-demo craft-chest — the window on Tools/Picks with the copper pickaxe selected, 5 ingots in the bag and 12 more in a chest nearby, the ingredient marked «(в сундуке)»); E2-15: --ui-demo half — a room with the wooden floor under all walls and up to them (the east wall stands in the west half of its tiles, the floor there only under the wall), a chest against the west wall and a workbench against the north wall shifted by half a tile, a torch at the south wall; E2-12: --ui-demo thin — a house of half-tile walls (stone outer ring with 3-cell corners, a closed door at the bottom, an open door on the right, a wooden partition with a T at the top wall, a cross and free ends, a thin fence), --ui-demo build now shows the green ghost as one 0.5 × 0.5 cell; C-008: Terraria-like windows — bag top-left, chest under it, crafting column bottom-left, hotbar between health and stamina orbs at the bottom; --ui-demo build-open — bag and crafting open, cursor over the world with the green ghost; inv-stone — Buildings/Stone, walls vs floors by silhouette); E2-17: --home-demo overview|south|north|behind|door|camp|fence — a house of half-tile walls with height (stone ring, a closed and an open door side by side on the south wall, vertical doors west/east, a wooden bedroom partition, bed, chests, workbench, torches, a campfire, a yard fence with a corner); E2-16: --ui-demo turn — beds 1 x 2 in all four rotations, workbenches 2 x 2 at 0 and 90 degrees, chests 0..270, a vertical half-tile wall with a vertical door, a green ghost of a bed taken from the crafting menu turned 90 degrees (label: R — rotate, from menu: available N); inv-buildings now shows the Place button in the recipe card; C-029: --ui-demo inv-ingredient (tooltip of a base ingredient with where-to-get, red remaining after crafting), inv-ingredient-open (click on a non-base ingredient opens its recipe), inv-ready (ready stone walls in the bag, no stone: the wall recipe is shown with only-available), worldmap (full-screen map, M), build now shows the checkerboard icon for single placement.",
